<fieldset><legend>Private supporting evidence · optional</legend><p>Attach business authority or role details for the reviewer. Do not upload applicant CVs, identity documents, bank details or confidential employee records. Evidence is stored privately and is not published or sent to AI.</p><label>Evidence document<input type="file" name="evidence" accept="application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png"></label><small>PDF, JPEG or PNG, up to 4 MB each. Up to five files per submission; add one per response.</small><label class="opp-check"><input type="checkbox" name="evidence_ack" value="1"> I have permission to store this evidence privately for editorial review.</label></fieldset>
